      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The spellsword wields sword, shield, and magic in many deadly combinations.
    With the shortsword, strike from precise angles to bypass enemy guards, but every
    swing drains stamina.\n\n A shield blocks incoming blows\u2014time it perfectly
    for a flawless defense.  <color=#5C0000>Magic lets you cast Fire, Ice, Thunder,
    or Draining spells</COLOR>, each with its own effect, but leaves you open if
    misused. Combine sword and magic for powerful attacks, though defense is limited.
    \n\n <color=#5C0000>Every action costs stamina or magic</color>, so manage your
    strength wisely. Switch between loadouts with <color=#5C0000> 1, 2, 3</color>,
    and master the balance of offense and defense to survive."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7324ebd53b455b44bba26fe21c53ccfe, type: 2}
