      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2103139285435589098, guid: 24eb3e11582b3ca40b4e4c5f2ad994ea, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Bound by duty and burdened by fate,<color=#5C0000> the Spellsword </color>awakens
        in the depths of a forsaken castle\u2014his armor shattered, his blade lost
        to the dark. Once a beacon of valor, he now walks among shadows where whispers
        of ancient evil linger in every hall.\n\nTo reclaim his honor, he must fight
        through the cursed stronghold, ascend its towering spires, and face the horrors
        that guard its heart. Each step forward draws him closer to the truth behind
        the corruption\u2014and to the final test of his resolve\n\n\n\nClimb to
        the highest tower, where the source of darkness awaits. But tread carefully\u2026
        for in this place,<color=#5C0000> death is never merciful</color>. Should
        you fall, the castle will reclaim your soul, and your trial will begin anew."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
